message: "If you use this model, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Dutch Hub WWTP–electrolysis–hydrogen System Dynamics model (IS2H4C)"
abstract: >-
  System Dynamics model of the integrated wastewater treatment plant and renewable
  hydrogen system of the Dutch Hub (H2Hub Twente): reclaimed water feeds an
  electrolyser, electrolytic oxygen partially replaces aeration, and an external
  supply with an order-up-to policy covers the demand not met on site. Includes the
  baseline model, verification scenarios S1-S3 and validation scenarios BV1-BV3
  documented in IS2H4C Deliverable D4.3, Section 5.3.
